    },
    {
      "id": "procrastination_short_003_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "そこって、作業そのものより怖い時がある。",
      "translatedText": "That place can sometimes be scarier than the work itself.",
      "emotion": "soft",
      "presentation": { "expression": "soft", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [
        { "label": "Open the file.", "nextId": "procrastination_short_003_03", "statChanges": [ { "target": "player", "stat": "taskProgress", "amount": 0.15, "op": "add" } ] },
        { "label": "Name the fear.", "nextId": "procrastination_short_003_03", "statChanges": [ { "target": "player", "stat": "stress", "amount": -0.15, "op": "add" } ] },
        { "label": "Two minutes only.", "nextId": "procrastination_short_003_03", "statChanges": [ { "target": "player", "stat": "focusEnergy", "amount": 0.15, "op": "add" } ] }
      ],
      "nextId": "procrastination_short_003_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "procrastination_short_003_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "今日は、完成まで見なくていい。入口だけ見る。",
      "translatedText": "Today, you do not have to look all the way to completion. Only look at the entrance.",
      "emotion": "focused",
      "presentation": { "expression": "focused", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "procrastination_short_003_04"
    },
    {
      "id": "procrastination_short_003_04",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "入口が見えたら、手を置く。まだ走らなくていい。",
      "translatedText": "Once you see the entrance, place your hand there. You do not have to run yet.",
      "emotion": "gentle",
      "presentation": { "expression": "gentle", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "procrastination_short_003_05"
    },
    {
      "id": "procrastination_short_003_05",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "私は横で数える。急かすためじゃなくて、迷子にならないために。",
      "translatedText": "I will count beside you. Not to rush you, but so you do not get lost.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "presentation": { "expression": "warm", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "procrastination_short_003_06"
    },
    {
      "id": "procrastination_short_003_06",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "一、二。はい、始まりの形はもうできた。",
